/ Une ligne de note de MISSION (epic #241, phase 2) : des kilomètres, pas des
  euros. Le montant n'est PAS saisi — c'est km × taux du jour de la ligne,
  calculé et figé côté modèle. L'afficher en champ modifiable inviterait à le
  corriger à la main, et une indemnité corrigée à la main ne s'explique plus.

  Le taux appliqué se lit à côté : un barème qui change en cours d'année doit
  se voir sur la ligne, pas seulement dans Paramètres > Tarifs.
.rounded-lg.border.border-gray-200.bg-white.p-4(data-expense-lines-target="row")
  .grid.grid-cols-1.gap-3(class="md:grid-cols-12")
    .md:col-span-2
      = line_form.date_field :spent_on, label: "Date *", class: "w-full", data: { expense_field: "spent_on" }
    .md:col-span-4
      = line_form.text_field :label, label: "Trajet ou motif *", placeholder: "Yvoir → Gembloux, pépinière", class: "w-full", data: { expense_field: "label" }
    .md:col-span-3
      = line_form.text_field :supplier_name, label: "Structure", placeholder: "CRA-W, Semisto…", class: "w-full"
    .md:col-span-2
      = line_form.label :distance_in_km, "Kilomètres *", class: "mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
      = text_field_tag "#{line_form.object_name}[distance_in_km]", line_form.object&.distance_in_km,
                       inputmode: "decimal", placeholder: "84", required: true,
                       class: "block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm text-right tabular-nums",
                       data: { expense_lines_target: "distance", action: "input->expense-lines#refresh" }
    .md:col-span-1.flex.items-end.justify-end.pb-1
      button.text-xs.font-medium.text-red-600(type="button" class="hover:underline" data-action="expense-lines#remove" aria-label="Retirer cette ligne")
        | Retirer

  .mt-3.grid.grid-cols-1.gap-3(class="md:grid-cols-12")
    .md:col-span-4
      = line_form.label :general_account_id, "Compte de charge *", class: "mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
      = line_form.collection_select :general_account_id, accounts, :id, :to_s,
                                    { include_blank: "Choisir un compte…" },
                                    class: "block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm text-sm",
                                    data: { expense_field: "general_account_id" }
    .md:col-span-3
      = line_form.label :team_id, "Pôle", class: "mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
      = line_form.collection_select :team_id, teams, :id, :name,
                                    { include_blank: "Aucun" },
                                    class: "block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm text-sm",
                                    data: { expense_field: "team_id" }
    .md:col-span-5.flex.items-end.pb-1
      .text-sm.text-gray-500
        - if line_form.object&.rate_per_km_money
          | Indemnité figée à
          strong.text-gray-900 =<> humanized_money_with_symbol(line_form.object.rate_per_km_money)
          | /km —
          strong.text-gray-900 =<> expense_amount(line_form.object.amount_cents)
        - else
          | Indemnité au barème du jour de la ligne :
          strong.text-gray-900 =<> humanized_money_with_symbol(Money.new(Pricing::Catalog.mileage_per_km_cents))
          | /km.

  - if line_form.object&.persisted?
    = line_form.hidden_field :_destroy, value: "0"
